# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOT IGNORED ON PURPOSE: the generated contract and golden vector files.
#
#   01-contract/contract.py
#   01-contract/contract_data.h
#   01-contract/contract_runtime.h
#   01-contract/golden_vectors.json
#   01-contract/golden_vectors.h
#
# These are committed so that any change to them shows up in a pull request.
# Most projects leave generated files out of version control, but here that
# would break the check: `python data_contract.py --check` compares these
# committed files with what the contract produces now, so without them it
# has nothing to compare against and stops protecting you.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
